          "id": 1145689398,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This broke the operation of the dissector. Please see attached screenshot where the CRC HASH is different to that in the actual body. \n\n![image](/uploads/90993a682b2c723a93ee3bc1ddd8c038/image.png)\n\nThis was not broken when `%lx` was used... I will see if I can fix the hex/int in another PR incorporating your change",
